Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.00,Title,,0,0,0,,GeoFlow IQ Studio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Gcomm Oracle to IQGEO Oracle cleansing workflow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:18.00,Title,,0,0,0,,1. Connect the Worker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:18.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Run GeoFlow worker near Oracle\NKeep credentials and heavy processing off the browser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,2. Profile Gcomm Oracle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:30.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Check row counts, duplicate IDs, null geometries,\Nstatus values, SRIDs, and invalid Oracle Spatial geometry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:43.00,Title,,0,0,0,,3. Define IQGEO Rules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:43.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Required fields, statuses, parent references,\Ngeometry rules, and field mappings become repeatable SQL checks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:57.00,Title,,0,0,0,,4. Telecom Association Logic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:57.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Nearest duct is not enough\NPrefer parallel alignment and flag perpendicular matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:10.00,Title,,0,0,0,,5. Submit Dry Run
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:10.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Generate checkpoints, progress, SQL plans,\Nand the audit trail before any write happens
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:23.00,Title,,0,0,0,,6. Split the Records
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:23.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Clean rows move forward\NReject, quarantine, and redundant rows stay auditable
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:36.00,Title,,0,0,0,,7. Approve Execute
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:36.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Execute jobs wait for operator approval\NOnly reviewed runs can merge into IQGEO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:47.20,Title,,0,0,0,,8. Merge Trusted Rows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:47.20,Body,,0,0,0,,Batch windows merge approved clean rows into IQGEO Oracle\NAI-assisted, rule-executed, human-approved cleansing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:47.20,Accent,,0,0,0,,Tech Mahindra-inspired walkthrough | No Oracle credentials in browser
